<title>UK: European precious metals end quiet day mixed.</title>
<headline>European precious metals end quiet day mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Finished just 60 cents lower at $319.20/$319.70. Steadier after selling took price lower late Tuesday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended three cents lower at $4.29/$4.32. Ignored, price barely moved all day.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished $2.00 firmer at $405.00/$409.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed at $176.75/$180.75, up $5.25.</p>
</text>
